=crop&w=3200",3200,1800,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Asia",[46],{"slug":47,"label":48},"hospitality","Hospitality","Brand asset creation, Interior Design,  Graphic Design, Art Direction, Signage.","\u003Cp>Defining the next chapter of Jollibee&rsquo;s story as it strives to bring the joy of eating to everyone and achieve its goal of becoming one of the top 5 restaurant companies of the world.\u003C/p>",[52,55,58],{"title":53,"copy":54},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>Jollibee tasked Shed to evolve the brand, including a new restaurant concept as part of its global expansion plan. The objective was to create a concept with a clear strategy that reflected the core brand spirit, ensuring it could become a recognisable global icon.\u003C/p>",{"title":56,"copy":57},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>Putting &lsquo;a smile at the heart of everything&rsquo; became a simple design mantra.\u003Cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;\u003C/span>Combined with a clear strategy: Be brave, be iconic and dare to embrace play.\u003C/p>",{"title":59,"copy":60},"The Solution","\u003Cp>The end result was a concept born out of the Jollibee spirit and resulting in a iconic design language that was ownable and\u003Cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;\u003C/span>instantly recognisable.\u003C/p>",[62,72,82],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":63},{"width":64,"height":65,"url":66,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":67},2094,1178,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1746693001-shed-jollibee-lr-04.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":68,"srcSet":69,"src":70,"width":64,"height":65,"sizes":71},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1746693001-shed-jollibee-lr-04.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1746693001-shed-jollibee-lr-04.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1746693001-shed-jollibee-lr-04.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1746693001-shed-